WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.333
Week 6: The Present: Regular Actions. describe habits ask about routines say how often something happens

2
00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:19.937
Operational objective. By the end of this section you can describe habits, ask about routines, say how often something happens. The focus is useful performance, not isolated terminology.

3
00:00:19.937 --> 00:00:27.206
Language system. Regular -ar, -er, and -ir present tense; subject omission; frequency expressions.

4
00:00:27.206 --> 00:00:33.920
Sound and delivery. Keep verb endings audible; do not reduce unstressed syllables to schwa.

5
00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:43.197
Core principle. Notice meaning first, then form. Retrieve the new language aloud, compare it with the model, and repair one feature at a time.

6
00:00:43.197 --> 00:01:08.559
Model language. Trabajo por la mañana y estudio por la noche. — I work in the morning and study at night. ¿Dónde vives? — Where do you live? Comemos juntos los viernes. — We eat together on Fridays. Ella escribe en su diario cada día. — She writes in her journal every day. A veces bebo café después de comer. — Sometimes I drink coffee after eating.

7
00:01:08.559 --> 00:01:18.457
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
